--- !u!114 &2015448183
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2015448179}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 66c9fa903b2f31c428731d8baacf4882, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  IndonesianText: "Kamu keluar dari kamar dengan langkah pelan, seperti yang Ibu
    Kost pernah bilang jangan berisik, jangan sembarangan.\r\n Setiap lorong kamu
    lewati dengan tenang, tak sekalipun kamu memanggil atau menantang suara-suara
    aneh itu.\r\n Dan saat sosok mengerikan itu muncul di ujung tangga...\r\n ...ia
    hanya menatapmu, lalu menghilang."
  EnglishText: "You step out of your room slowly, just as the landlady once told
    you \u2014 don\u2019t make noise, don\u2019t act carelessly.\nEach hallway you
    pass through in silence, never once calling out or provoking those strange sounds.\nAnd
    when that horrifying figure appears at the end of the stairs\u2026\n\u2026it
    simply stares at you, then vanishes."
  KoreanText: 
  ChineseText: 
  ArabianText: 
  JapaneseText: 
  StartEvents:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  UpdateEvents:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
